New: The class parallel::DefaultTriangulation selects the best available
parallel triangulation implementation at compile time (serial Triangulation,
parallel::distributed::Triangulation, or parallel::shared::Triangulation with
artificial cells). dealii::Triangulation now also provides a constructor that
takes an MPI communicator so that serial meshes can be built with the same
interface.
